#. <xref linkend="sysprof"/>
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend='cairo'/> (for some GObject Introspection tests), <xref "
"linkend=\"dbus\"/> (for some tests), <xref linkend=\"fuse3\"/> and <ulink "
"url=\"https://bindfs.org/\">bindfs</ulink> (both needed for one test), <xref"
" linkend=\"gdb\"/> (for bindings), <xref linkend='gjs'/> (for some GObject "
"Introspection tests), <xref linkend='gtk-doc'/> (for GObject Introspection "
"documentation), <xref linkend=\"DocBook\"/>, <xref linkend=\"docbook-"
"xsl\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (to build API documentation), <xref "
"linkend=\"glib-networking\"/> (for some tests, but this is a circular "
"dependency), <xref linkend=\"Mako\"/> and <xref linkend=\"markdown\"/> (both"
" for <command>g-ir-doc-tool</command>), and <ulink url=\"&sysprof-"
"url;\">sysprof</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend='cairo'/> (para alguns testes do GObject Introspection), <xref"
" linkend=\"dbus\"/> (para alguns testes), <xref linkend=\"fuse3\"/> e <ulink"
" url=\"https://bindfs.org/\">bindfs</ulink> (ambos necessários para um "
"teste), <xref linkend=\"gdb\"/> (para ligações), <xref linkend='gjs'/> (para"
" alguns testes do GObject Introspection), <xref linkend='gtk-doc'/> (para "
"documentação do GObject Introspection), <xref linkend=\"DocBook\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"docbook-xsl\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (para construir "
"documentação de API), <xref linkend=\"glib-networking\"/> (para alguns "
"testes, mas isso é uma dependência circular), <xref linkend=\"Mako\"/> e "
"<xref linkend=\"markdown\"/> (ambos para <command>g-ir-doc-tool</command>) e"
" <ulink url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid "Additional Runtime Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependências Adicionais de Tempo de Execução"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Quoted directly from the <filename>INSTALL</filename> file: <quote>Some of "
"the mimetype-related functionality in GIO requires the <command>update-mime-"
"database</command> and <command>update-desktop-database</command> "
"utilities,</quote> which are part of <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"shared-mime-info\"/> and <xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"desktop-"
"file-utils\"/>, respectively.  These two utilities are also needed for some "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"Citado diretamente a partir do arquivo <filename>INSTALL</filename>: "
"<quote>Algumas das funcionalidades relacionadas ao tipo mime no GIO exigem "
"os utilitários <command>update-mime-database</command> e <command>update-"
"desktop-database</command></quote>, os quais são parte de <xref "
"role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"shared-mime-info\"/> e <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/>, respectivamente. Esses dois utilitários "
"também são necessários para alguns testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GLib"
msgstr "Instalação de GLib"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If desired, apply the optional patch. In many cases, applications that use "
"this library, either directly or indirectly via other libraries such as "
"<xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, output numerous warnings when run from the command"
" line.  This patch enables the use of an environment variable, "
"<envar>GLIB_LOG_LEVEL</envar>, that suppresses unwanted messages. The value "
"of the variable is a digit that corresponds to:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejado, aplique o remendo opcional. Em muitos casos, os aplicativos que"
" usam essa biblioteca, direta ou indiretamente, por meio de outras "
"bibliotecas, tais como <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, emitem numerosos avisos "
"quando executados a partir da linha de comando. Esse remendo habilita o uso "
"de uma variável de ambiente, <envar>GLIB_LOG_LEVEL</envar>, que suprime "
"mensagens indesejadas. O valor da variável é um dígito que corresponde a:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid "1 Alert"
msgstr "1 Alerta"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:174
#, xml-text
msgid "2 Critical"
msgstr "2 Crítico"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid "3 Error"
msgstr "3 Erro"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid "4 Warning"
msgstr "4 Aviso"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><simplelist><member>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:177
#, xml-text
msgid "5 Notice"
msgstr "5 Informe"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:181
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For instance <userinput>export GLIB_LOG_LEVEL=4</userinput> will skip output"
" of Warning and Notice messages (and Info/Debug messages if they are turned "
"on).  If <envar>GLIB_LOG_LEVEL</envar> is not defined, normal message output"
" will not be affected."
msgstr ""
"Por exemplo, <userinput>export GLIB_LOG_LEVEL=4</userinput> pulará a saída "
"gerada de mensagens Warning e Notice (e mensagens de Informação/Depuração se"
" estiverem ativadas). Se <envar>GLIB_LOG_LEVEL</envar> não estiver definida,"
" a saída gerada normal de mensagem não será afetada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:187
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../glib-skip_warnings-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../glib-skip_warnings-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If a previous version of glib is installed, move the headers out of the way "
"so that later packages do not encounter conflicts:"
msgstr ""
"Se uma versão anterior da glib estiver instalada, [então] mova os cabeçalhos"
" para fora do caminho, de modo que os pacotes posteriores não encontrem "
"conflitos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:195
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">if [ -e /usr/include/glib-2.0 ]; then\n"
"    rm -rf /usr/include/glib-2.0.old &amp;&amp;\n"
"    mv -vf /usr/include/glib-2.0{,.old}\n"
"fi</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">if [ -e /usr/include/glib-2.0 ]; then\n"
"    rm -rf /usr/include/glib-2.0.old &amp;&amp;\n"
"    mv -vf /usr/include/glib-2.0{,.old}\n"
"fi</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GLib</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>GLib</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:207
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                 \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"      -Dintrospection=disabled \\\n"
"      -Dman-pages=enabled      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                 \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"      -Dintrospection=disabled \\\n"
"      -Dman-pages=enabled      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:218
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>GLib</application> test suite requires "
"<application>desktop-file-utils</application> for some tests. However, "
"<application>desktop-file-utils</application> requires "
"<application>GLib</application> in order to compile; therefore, you must "
"first install <application>GLib</application> and then run the test suite."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste da <application>GLib</application> exige "
"<application>desktop-file-utils</application> para alguns testes. No "
"entanto, <application>desktop-file-utils</application> exige a "
"<application>GLib</application> para a finalidade de compilar; portanto, "
"você precisa primeiro instalar a <application>GLib</application> e então "
"executar a suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, install this "
"package for the first time to allow building GObject Introspection:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, "
"instale esse pacote pela primeira vez para permitir construir o GObject "
"Introspection:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:232 blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:279
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid "Build GObject Introspection:"
msgstr "Construa GObject Introspection:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:238
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar xf ../../gobject-introspection-&gobject-introspection-version;.tar.xz &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup gobject-introspection-&gobject-introspection-version; gi-build \\\n"
"            --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release     &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja -C gi-build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar xf ../../gobject-introspection-&gobject-introspection-version;.tar.xz &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup gobject-introspection-&gobject-introspection-version; gi-build \\\n"
"            --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release     &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja -C gi-build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results of GObject Introspection, issue: <command>ninja -C gi-"
"build test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados do GObject Introspection, emita: <command>ninja -C"
" gi-build test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the &root; user, install GObject Introspection for generating the "
"introspection data of GLib libraries (required by various packages using "
"Glib, especially some GNOME packages):"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, instale o GObject Introspection para gerar os "
"dados de introspecção das bibliotecas GLib (requeridos por vários pacotes "
"usantes do Glib, especialmente alguns pacotes do GNOME):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:255
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja -C gi-build install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja -C gi-build install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid "Now generate the introspection data:"
msgstr "Agora gere os dados de introspecção:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:261
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>meson configure -Dintrospection=enabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>meson configure -Dintrospection=enabled &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:265
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> installed and wish to build the API "
"documentation for this package, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> instalado e desejar construir a "
"documentação da API para esse pacote, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:269
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed 's/glib-2.0/glib-&glib2-version;/'        \\\n"
"    -i ../docs/reference/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -Ddocumentation=true &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed 's/glib-2.0/glib-&glib2-version;/'        \\\n"
"    -i ../docs/reference/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -Ddocumentation=true &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:275
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the &root; user, install this package again for the introspection data "
"(and optionally, the documentation):"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, instale esse pacote novamente para os dados de "
"introspecção (e, opcionalmente, a documentação):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:282
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You should now install <xref linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> and <xref "
"linkend=\"shared-mime-info\"/> and proceed to run the test suite."
msgstr ""
"Você deveria agora instalar <xref linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"shared-mime-info\"/> e proceder à execução da suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><warning><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/glib2.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Do not run the test suite as &root; or some tests will fail unexpectedly and"
" leave some non-FHS-compliant directories in the <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr</filename> hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Não execute a suíte de teste como &root; ou alguns testes falharão "
